{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21985","headline":"续古诗十首 一 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戚戚复戚戚，送君远行役。\n行役非中原，海外黄沙碛。\n伶俜独居妾，迢遰长征客。\n君望功名归，妾忧生死隔。\n谁家无夫妇，何人不离坼。\n所恨薄命身，嫁迟别日迫。\n妾身有存殁，妾心无改易。\n生作闺中妇，死作山头石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}